      "message": "Second to Grzegorz\u0027s point here. \n\nWe can\u0027t guarantee all broadcasters are following Auracast\u0027s spec, and we\u0027d also need to be backward compatible. \n\nFor the \u0027PA + no BIG\u0027 broadcaster, should we report those in such case? otherwise, what\u0027s the benefit of connecting to a broadcaster without audio data?",
